      "product_id": "prod_bdb1bbccf845",
      "name": "Test Bold Description Product",
      "description": "<p>Meet your new everyday obsession. The Aura Black Crossbody bag combines minimalist elegance with undeniable utility. Crafted from a premium, textured vegan leather, its deep black hue offers a versatile sophistication that transitions effortlessly from day to night.\nDesigned for the modern woman on the move, it features a padded pocket to safeguard your phone and multiple card slots for daily essentials, all secured by a smooth, magnetic flap closure. The adjustable, detachable strap allows you to customize your carry\u2014wear it crossbody for hands-free errands, shorten it for a chic shoulder look, or remove it entirely to use as a sleek clutch.\nMore than just a bag, the Aura is your curated companion for coffee runs, office commutes, and evening outings. Its compact yet perfectly proportioned design holds all you need without the bulk, ensuring you look polished and prepared, wherever the day takes you.\n\n<b>Key Features:</b>\n\n- Hands-Free Convenience: Adjustable crossbody strap for ultimate comfort and security.\n- Organized Interior: Features a dedicated phone pocket, card slots, and a main compartment.\n- Versatile Style: Detachable strap converts bag into a chic clutch for evening wear.\n- Premium Finish: Crafted from high-quality, cruelty-free vegan leather with a luxe feel.\n- Secure Closure: Easy-access magnetic flap keeps contents safe.\n\n<b>Specs: \n</b>\n- Dimensions: 9\"W x 6\"H x 2.5\"D. \n- Strap Drop: Adjustable from 20\" to 28\".\n- Material: Premium Vegan Leather</p>",
